commodore-900-coh-kernel3
==========================

COHERENT 3.x kernel sources for the Zilog Z8001-based Commodore 900. This
repository contains the portable kernel, Z8001 machine layer, console drivers,
kernel headers, and host-side build tools.

`kernel3` describes the source lineage. It is separate from the older
0.7-derived kernel.

Building
--------

    make deps                 fetch the pinned toolchain and kboot inputs
    make                      build the kernel
    make drivers              build the loadable console drivers
    make kernel-dist          create the kernel package
    make kernel-headers-dist  create the standalone headers package
    make check-stamps         verify kernel/driver link IDs
    make check-shared         compare shared headers with the toolchain
    make clean
    make help

The kernel is written to `os/hostbuild/kobj/kernel.out`. Set
`C900_TOOLCHAIN` or `C900_KBOOT` to use local checkouts instead of the inputs
selected by `DEPS`.

This repository builds kernel artifacts only. Disk images and userland are
built in their respective repositories.

